OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of US Embassy staffer from
OL,4,AUK 'unforgivable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe removal from the UK of a US embassy
OL,7,Fstaffer accused of possessing indecent
OL,8,Fimages is "unforgivable", says the
OL,9,Fmother of Harry Dunn.
OL,11,FThe staff member was flown out of the
OL,12,FUK without being questioned by British
OL,13,Fpolice.
OL,15,FCharlotte Charles, whose son was killed
OL,16,Fby US citizen Anne Sacoolas in a road
OL,17,Fcrash outside a Northamptonshire
OL,18,Fairbase, said the situation had "all
OL,19,Fthe hallmarks" of Harry's case.
OL,20,FSacoolas left the UK after diplomatic
OL,21,Fimmunity was asserted on her behalf.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
