OL,3,GNEWSARemoval of US Embassy staffer from
OL,4,AUK 'unforgivable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Embassy said inquiries were
OL,7,Fongoing in conjunction with UK
OL,8,Fauthorities. A UK government
OL,9,Fspokesperson declined to comment,
OL,10,Fciting the ongoing US investigation,
OL,11,Fbut said Britain expected foreign
OL,12,Fdiplomats to obey the law.
